              "id": "312498e7-653b-44f2-8051-b3b36e246823",
              "name": "data",
              "value": "TaskFlow — Support Knowledge Base  Pricing & Plans  TaskFlow offers three plans: - Free Plan: Up to 3 team members, 2 active projects, 100MB file storage. No credit card required. - Pro Plan: $12 per user/month (billed monthly) or $10 per user/month (billed annually). Unlimited projects, 10GB file storage per user, priority email support. - Business Plan: $22 per user/month (billed monthly) or $18 per user/month (billed annually). Unlimited everything, 50GB storage per user, dedicated account manager, SSO/SAML login, priority phone support.  Free Trial  TaskFlow offers a 14-day free trial of the Pro Plan — no credit card required to start. At the end of the trial, the account automatically reverts to the Free Plan unless the user upgrades. No charges happen automatically.  Cancellation & Refund Policy  Users can cancel their subscription anytime from Settings → Billing → Cancel Subscription. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing cycle — no partial refunds are issued for unused time within a billing period. However, if a user is charged in error or cancels within 7 days of a charge, they are eligible for a full refund by contacting support.  Integrations  TaskFlow currently integrates with: Slack, Google Calendar, Google Drive, Zoom, and GitHub. Integration setup is available under Settings → Integrations on the Pro and Business plans only (not available on the Free plan).  Data Export & Account Deletion  Users can export all their project data as CSV or JSON anytime from Settings → Data Export. Account deletion is permanent and removes all data after a 30-day grace period, during which the account can be restored by contacting support.  Team Member Limits  - Free Plan: 3 members max - Pro Plan: unlimited members, billed per active member per month - Business Plan: unlimited members, billed per active member per month, with volume discounts available for 50+ seats (contact sales)  Support Hours  Email support is available 24/7 with typical response times of under 4 hours for Pro/Business customers, and under 24 hours for Free plan users. Phone support (Business plan only) is available Monday–Friday, 9 AM–6 PM EST.  Common Technical Issues  - Login issues: Most login problems are resolved by clearing browser cache or resetting the password via the \"Forgot Password\" link. TaskFlow does not currently support login via personal Gmail/Google OAuth — only email/password or SSO (Business plan). - File upload failures: Usually caused by exceeding the plan's storage limit or a single file exceeding 25MB (max file size on all plans). - Mobile app: TaskFlow has iOS and Android apps, but currently does not support offline mode — an internet connection is required to sync changes.  Security & Compliance  TaskFlow is SOC 2 Type II compliant and encrypts all data at rest and in transit. TaskFlow does not currently offer HIPAA compliance and is not recommended for storing protected health information.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
